# Route: guide 43 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to
# 59, 34 quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (The Hinterlands, Alterac Mountains, Felwood, Winterspring, Blasted
# Lands, Swamp of Sorrows): Shaol'watha -> Jintha'Alor -> The Overlook Cliffs
# -> Dalaran -> Growless Cave -> Dandred's Fold -> Emerald Sanctuary ->
# Jaedenar -> Irontree Woods -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Bloodvenom Falls ->
# Emerald Sanctuary -> Irontree Woods -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Recover the Key! (7846; Hitah'ya
# the Keeper 51); Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions (7861; Vile
# Priestess Hexx 51, Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guard 50-51); The Crown of Will
# (520; Mug'thol 43); High Chief Winterfall (5121; High Chief Winterfall 59);
# The Final Piece (5123; High Chief Winterfall 59).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Jammal'an the Prophet (1446), Heart of Disruption (96984),
# The Grave Knight (96986), Opportunistic Education (96987).

